Mimo-v2.6-pro is Mimo's flagship general-purpose model from the v2.6 series, released in 2026, designed for complex reasoning, coding, and knowledge work. It features competitive pricing and strong performance across agentic benchmarks. The model ranks 23rd overall with a score of 91.0/100, indicating strong performance in the frontier model landscape. Mimo-v2.6-pro is part of the v2.6 series alongside Mimo-v2.6-free and Mimo-v2.6-flash, offering different capabilities and pricing tiers.

